-Estate?---Montcalm-County,-Michigan-Tax-Deed-Investing\">How to Score Properties 40-90% Off in Montcalm County, Michigan Tax Deed Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Investing in Montcalm County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan&#8217;s</mark></a> tax foreclosure sales is a fantastic way to acquire properties at significantly reduced prices. With discounts ranging from 40% to 90%, these sales offer a golden opportunity for savvy investors.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-It-Works\">How It Works</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Montcalm County holds its tax foreclosure sales online, typically in August and October. Here’s a step-by-step guide to getting started:</p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Register and Secure Your Spot</strong>: To participate, you need to register and place a $1,000 hold on your credit card. This hold acts as a security deposit and ensures you are serious about your bids.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Start Bidding</strong>: Bidding opens 30 days before the auction date. You can place your maximum bid during this period, which will be used to automatically bid on your behalf up to your limit.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bidding Phases</strong>: In Montcalm County, there are two bidding phases &#8211; advance and active. In the advance phase, you can place, modify, or delete your bids. During the active phase, you can only place new bids or increase existing ones.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Winning and Payment</strong>: If you win, you’ll receive an email with payment instructions. The total payment includes your winning bid, a 10% buyer’s premium, current taxes, and a $30 deed recording fee. Payments must be made within five business days using wire transfer, cashier’s check, or credit card.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-here-are-the-key-details-for-montcalm-county-tax-deed-sales\">Here are the key details for Montcalm County tax deed sales:</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Montcalm-County-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Montcalm-County-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Montcalm-County-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Montcalm-County-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Montcalm-County-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Montcalm-County-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Montcalm-County-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Montcalm-County-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Montcalm-County-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Montcalm-County-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Montcalm-County-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Montcalm-County-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Montcalm-County-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18323 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Montcalm County Courthouse\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-conte